  "returns": "\n\n            <p>An empty dictionary if the entries were successfully created.</p>\n        ",
  "errors": "\n\n    \n    \n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            \n                <p><b>object_invalid</b> - object is in invalid state.</p>\n\n                \n\n                \n                    <p>Possible reasons:</p>\n                    <ul>\n                        \n                        <li>\n                            \n                                <p><b>no_students</b> -\n                                the group does not have any participants.</p>\n                            \n                        </li>\n                        \n                    </ul>\n                \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li>\n            \n                <p><b>object_not_found</b> - some of the referenced objects do not exist.</p>\n\n                \n\n                \n                    <p>Possible reasons:</p>\n                    <ul>\n                        \n                        <li>\n                            \n                                <p><b>group_not_found</b> -\n                                specified course group does not exist or user is not its lecturer;</p>\n                            \n                        </li>\n                        \n                        <li>\n                            \n                                <p><b>meeting_not_found</b> -\n                                specified course group has no meetings.</p>\n                            \n                        </li>\n                        \n                    </ul>\n                \n            \n        </li>\n        \n    </ul>\n",
